menu "Status LED Configuration"

    config STATUS_LED_GPIO
        int "Status LED GPIO Number (-1 to disable)"
        range -1 30
        default 15
        help
            GPIO pin for the status / identify LED (GPIO 15 is the onboard yellow User LED on Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32C6).
            Set to -1 to disable the status LED.

    config STATUS_LED_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "Status LED is Active-Low"
        depends on STATUS_LED_GPIO >= 0
        default y
        help
            Enable if the status LED turns on when GPIO is driven low (0), such as on Seeed Studio XIAO ESP32C6.

endmenu
